  "priorExpiration": "2007-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 1102.06 Permit Renewals. Renewal of permits shall be the responsibility of the permittee. Failure of the commission to notify the permittee shall not extend the existing permit or excuse shipment into New Hampshire without a permit.\n\nSource. #6837, Interim, eff 9-1-98, EXPIRED: 12-30-98\n\nNew. #6924, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRED: 1-1-07\n\nNew. #9441-A, eff 6-9-11; ss by #12968, eff 1-3-20 (formerly Liq 1102.05)",
